{
 "title": "运算符",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "算术运算：`+ - * / %`。对整数而言，`/` 会丢掉小数部分（`20 / 3` 是 6），`%` 给出余数（`20 % 3` 是 2）。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    print(10 + 20, 30 - 5, 4 * 6)",
    "    print(20 / 3, 20 % 3)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "30 25 24",
    "6 2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "比较会得到 `true` 或 `false`（一个 bool）：`== != < > <= >=`。逻辑运算符用单词书写：`and`、`or`、`not`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    number = 15",
    "    print(number > 10, number == 20)",
    "    print(number > 10 and number < 20)",
    "    print(not (number > 10))"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "true false",
    "true",
    "false"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "在 Greengold 中，位运算符（`&`、`|`、`^`、`<<`、`>>`）会**先于**比较运算执行，所以 `bits & 1 == 0` 就是你期望的 `(bits & 1) == 0`。（C 语言里的那个陷阱在这里不存在。）"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    bits = 6",
    "    print(bits & 1 == 0)",
    "    print(1 << 4)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "true",
    "16"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c01-l03-x1",
   "prompt": "如果 `n` 是偶数就输出 `true`，是奇数就输出 `false`。（`n % 2 == 0`）",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    n = 14",
    "    print(false)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn main():",
    "    n = 14",
    "    print(n % 2 == 0)"
   ],
   "hint": "输出条件本身，而不是 `false`。",
   "expected": [
    "true"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
